# WOBBLE DERBY: the demo punter plays a whole six-race meeting from the
# title screen with button presses alone: it pays the tip booth for one look
# at the favourite, buys its pick a pep snack from the fixer, backs the best
# value it can see, sponsors a wobbler from the stables, borrows and
# goes all in at the end if it's behind, and reads the news and the pay
# window until the final count.
seed 11
game wobble
wait 20
expect state == 0
botuntil state == 5 600
expect round == 1
botuntil sponsored0 == 1 2000
botuntil tips0 >= 1 2000
botuntil job0 == 1 2000
botuntil round == 2 8000
botuntil state == 11 60000
expect done == 1
expect round == 6
expect stat_games == 1
expect has_run == 0
botuntil state == 0 400
